t_text","text":"简化，仅文字解释\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"每个事件池先设计3个事件，仅仅文字列表和一句话说明\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"先完成剧情对话池子；5个剧情；每个剧情一开始，地图边缘走来一个NPC，找到角色进行自动对话；请求角色收留；对话内容由ai设计；角色可以选择收留和拒绝。选择收留NPC留在地图随机游走；选择拒绝，NPC走出地图消失。一共5个可移动NPC。开始设计5个事件，剧情之间每个NPC跟角色设计的对话需要关联。\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"修改，诺亚带来关于灾难可能发生的消息；文文带来超级怪物的考古信息\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"开始代码设计世界剧情并加入游戏\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"进入游戏后开始剧情\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"编辑器没有之前保存的地图\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"NPC对话一句一句产生，玩家按空格键继续出现对话语句，最后才出现选择按钮，按钮快捷键为为Y和N\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"选择拒绝后NPC走到地图边缘会消失\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"打开任意地图都开始加载剧情\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"游戏输赢判定仅仅为玩家是否死亡\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"优化NPCAI运动逻辑，出现卡住情况会自动寻路\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"将可移动NPC和系统加载的NPC区分开；玩家自己加入的NPC不可对话；仅仅自由移动；系统加载的NPC头像出现光点标记，可以对话。\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏2026-05-31 16.40.34.png: /var/folders/nd/fkt5ppxs6635vd7rfflhlc7c0000gn/T/TemporaryItems/NSIRD_screencaptureui_OYiR86/截屏2026-05-31 16.40.34.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\naccept 和reject 位置放在对话的后面\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏